<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia details April inflation figures.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details April inflation figures.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a breakdown of Indonesia's inflation in April, according to a government official.</p>
<p>			   Apr	 Mar	Apr 96</p>
<p>    Month/month    +0.56     -0.12	 +0.78</p>
<p>    Year/year	+4.95     +5.17	 +7.95</p>
<p>CPI sectors (month/month)</p>
<p>    Food	     +0.01     -0.35</p>
<p>    Housing	  +0.96     +0.22</p>
<p>    Textiles	 +0.07     +0.16</p>
<p>    Services	 +0.97     -0.40</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
